    // FAQ
    faqHeadline: "Common Questions",
    faq1Q: "What does the single athlete license cost?",
    faq1A: "The single athlete license is 59 DKK/month. It's for the individual athlete who wants to track their own development with a personal training plan and progress stats.",
    faq2Q: "What does the club license cost?",
    faq2A: "The club license is 1,299 DKK/month and covers up to 25 users. It includes all features including video analysis, team statistics, PDF reports, season calendar and priority support.",
    faq3Q: "Can I start for free?",
    faq3A: "Yes. You get a 30-day free trial. When you create your club, you get 2 months free so you can try all features without risk.",
    faq4Q: "What do I get as a single athlete for 59 DKK/month?",
    faq4A: "You get a personal training plan, competition overview, messages from your coach and progress statistics. Everything you need as an individual athlete.",
    faq5Q: "What does the club get for 1,299 DKK/month?",
    faq5A: "Up to 25 athlete accounts, video analysis & notes, team statistics & PDF reports, collaborative season calendar, training plan builder, mental coaching & check-ins, injury follow-up and priority support.",

