    changelog_2026_04_20: "April 20, 2026",
    changelogEntry63: "Competition planning — add events with weight class and priority, generate peaking and weight-cut plans",
    changelogEntry64: "Morning readiness check — daily 10-second check that adapts today's training volume",
    changelogEntry65: "Push notifications — training, diary, and competition reminders straight to your phone",
    changelogEntry66: "Full translation of Competitions, Readiness and Notifications across all 6 languages",
    changelog_2026_04_22: "April 22, 2026",
    changelogEntry67: "Match Analysis — upload sparring or poomsae clips, tag techniques with timestamps, get scoring efficiency and side balance charts",
    changelogEntry68: "Form Curve — single chart fusing training load, recovery strain and test output with overtraining warning",
    changelogEntry69: "Coach weekly digest — every Monday, coaches get one email with athletes trending up, at risk and inactive",
    changelogEntry70: "Competition auto-taper — adding a competition automatically reduces volume in the two weeks before the event",
    changelogEntry71: "Coach messaging — select athletes in the coach dashboard and send free-form announcements via email and the in-app inbox",
    changelogEntry72: "Messages now have their own tab in the Coach Dashboard, with search, select-all, and an inline composer",
    changelogEntry73: "Match Analysis help section is now featured at the top of the help center",
    changelog_2026_04_23: "April 23, 2026",
    changelogEntry74: "Stronger password rules — minimum 8 characters with at least one letter and one number",
    changelogEntry75: "Admin club-scope filter — focus the approval and payments pages on a single club",
    changelogEntry76: "Club chips next to athlete names across coach and admin views to prevent cross-club confusion",
    changelogEntry77: "\"Manage Users\" renamed to \"Admin\" in the dashboard side menu",
    changelogEntry78: "New \"Who it's for / Problem / Solution\" section on the landing page",
    changelogEntry79: "Season Planner — visualize your full season with periodization phases (GPP → SPP → Peak → Transition) auto-built around A-priority competitions",
    changelogEntry80: "Per-exercise coach feedback — coaches leave quick reactions (👍 🔥 ⚠️ 🔁) and short comments on logged sets; athletes see a pulsing badge until they read it",
    changelogEntry81: "Coach dashboard restructured — Squad tab merges Overview and Athletes with pulse stats (need attention / injured / no plan / inactive), search, filters, and a unified card with severity borders",
    changelogEntry82: "Mental assessment history fixed — past results open reliably (with safe advice parsing), entries show a Tap to view affordance, deletes now require confirmation, and assessments without advice can be regenerated on demand",
    changelogEntry83: "Coach athlete detail reorganized into tabs (Profile & Plan, Mental, Performance, Activity) — mental assessments are now one tap away instead of hidden below a long scroll",
