    homeCh6Label: "The founder",
    homeCh6Title: "40 years on the floor",
    homeFounderEyebrow: "A NOTE FROM THE FOUNDER",
    homeFounderRole: "Founder & head coach",
    homeFounderQuote: "I've coached athletes for 40 years. What stopped them was rarely talent — it was that nobody kept an eye on the whole picture.",
    homeFounderBody: "Sportstalent wasn't drawn on a whiteboard. It came out of the folders, notes and spreadsheets I dragged around for decades. The goal is simple: that in ten years a club can still see what worked for this athlete today.",
