    homeCh8Title: "What clubs ask us",
    homeFaqEyebrow: "QUESTIONS",
    homeFaqTitle: "What clubs ask us",
    homeFaq1Q: "What does it cost?",
    homeFaq1A: "49 DKK per athlete per month for 1–10 athletes. It drops by tier: 47 (11–20), 44 (21–30), 42 (31–40) and 39 DKK (41–50). Everything is included — no add-on modules.",
    homeFaq2Q: "Can an individual athlete buy access?",
    homeFaq2A: "No. Sportstalent is sold to clubs and federations only. Athletes and parents get access through their club — which is also how the data stays consolidated and gets cleaned up after a season.",
    homeFaq3Q: "Who owns our athletes' data?",
    homeFaq3A: "The club. We are the processor, you are the controller. Data is stored in the EU, a processing agreement is in place, and you can export or delete everything at any time.",
    homeFaq4Q: "How long does onboarding take?",
    homeFaq4A: "Under an hour to set up club, teams and coaches. Athletes join with a code and are running in minutes. We join the kickoff meeting.",
    homeFaq5Q: "Does it work for our sport?",
    homeFaq5A: "Yes. The structure — plan, load, testing, injury, mental form — is the same across sports. You adapt exercises, tests and the technique library to your own sport.",
    homeFaq6Q: "Are we locked in?",
    homeFaq6A: "The agreement runs a year at a time and only renews if you say yes. No automatic price escalation, and your data comes with you if you leave.",
