    aboutSeoDesc: "Sportstalent is the operating system for elite talent development in Danish clubs — built by a 40-year veteran coach. Secure, GDPR-compliant, and designed for clubs that demand results.",
    aboutSeoTitle: "About Sportstalent — Club Coaching Software",
    aboutBadge: "ABOUT",
    aboutH1a: "Built by a coach ",
    aboutH1b: "not by a software house",
    aboutIntro: "Sportstalent came out of 40 years in club life: too much paperwork, too little time with the athletes and no shared history when a coach moved on.",
    aboutFounderLabel: "THE FOUNDER",
    aboutFounderRole: "Founder & Head Coach, 40-year veteran developing elite club athletes",
    aboutFounderYears: "years in sport",
    aboutFounderQuote: "\"I've watched far too many talents disappear — not from lack of ability, but because nobody kept an eye on the whole picture.\"",
    aboutFounderP2a: "I've coached athletes for four decades, from first session to international level. For all of it, my most important tool was a folder of notes. Nobody else could read it, and it didn't follow the athlete when they changed coach.",
    aboutFounderP2b: "Sportstalent is that folder — rewritten so the whole club can read it, and so it still exists in ten years. The goal isn't more screens. It's letting the coach spend the time on the person in front of them.",
    aboutTag1: "40-year veteran",
    aboutTag2: "Head coach 40+ years",
    aboutTag3: "GDPR-compliant",
    aboutTag4: "CVR 33685815",
    aboutMissionLabel: "MISSION",
    aboutMissionA: "Sportstalent.dk is a Danish platform built specifically for competitive sport. We believe the best coaches deserve the best tools — and that systems, data and technology should serve the sport, not the other way round.",
    aboutMissionB: "Our mission is to make it easier to coach well. To give coaches time, overview and insight — so they can focus on what matters most: developing athletes.",
    aboutValuesLabel: "OUR VALUES",
    aboutValuesTitle: "What we believe in",
    aboutV1Title: "The hall first",
    aboutV1Desc: "We coach ourselves. No feature ships before it's been used in a real training week.",
    aboutV2Title: "Numbers over hunches",
    aboutV2Desc: "The instinct is still the coach's. We just make sure it rests on something written down.",
    aboutV3Title: "The relationship is the tool",
    aboutV3Desc: "The platform should buy more time for the conversation between coach and athlete — not replace it.",
