    changelog_2026_07_21: "July 21, 2026",
    changelogEntry177: "Bottom navigation now shows on tablet and web, not only phone. Spanish translations completed for exercise cards and onboarding hints. Fixed raw key labels in the 'Add athlete' menu.",
    changelog_2026_07_22: "July 22, 2026",
    changelogEntry179: "Removed the individual \"Coach\" plan from the pricing page. SportsTalent is sold to clubs and organizations; athletes and coaches get access through their club. Existing subscribers keep their access.",
    changelog_2026_07_26: "July 26, 2026",
    changelog_2026_07_27: "July 27, 2026",
    changelog_2026_07_30: "July 30, 2026",
    changelog_2026_08_01: "August 1, 2026",
    changelogEntry194: "Club Assessment report email: the result is sent as an email right after completion — level, breakdown across the five areas and the three steps in the order they should be taken. Includes a login-free unsubscribe link. The profile fields after the result are now protected by a short-lived, single-use token.",
    changelogEntry193: "Club Assessment: a new public self-evaluation at sportstalent.dk/klubanalyse — 15 questions across five areas give the club a maturity level set by its weakest link, plus the three gaps that cost the most.",
    changelog_2026_07_29: "July 29, 2026",
    changelog_2026_07_28: "July 28, 2026",
    changelogEntry182: "Today's card can now switch between your own plan and the club season plan.",
    coachSetupTitle: "Get started",
    coachSetupProgress: "{done} of {total} steps completed",
    coachSetupDone: "Your club is ready",
    coachSetupDismiss: "Hide",
    coachSetupOptional: "Optional",
    coachSetupStepSchedule: "Set the team's weekly schedule",
    coachSetupStepScheduleDesc: "Decide what each weekday is (sport, strength, rest). It drives both the season calendar and the athletes' daily plan.",
    coachSetupStepSeason: "Create a season plan",
    coachSetupStepSeasonDesc: "Lay out phases and periods across the season.",
    coachSetupStepAthletes: "Invite your athletes",
    coachSetupStepAthletesDesc: "Athletes get access through an invitation or club code.",
    coachSetupStepVisibility: "Choose who sees the season plan",
    coachSetupStepVisibilityDesc: "Optional — by default everyone in the club sees it.",
    changelogEntry184: "The \"Today\" card now shows all sessions of the day (e.g. taekwondo + strength), respects your personal changes to the club plan and competition days, marks genuine rest days, and finds the right weekday in your own plan.",
    changelogEntry185: "The help centre has been updated so the guides match the current features: new guides for the \"Today\" card, running training, competitions & weight, the coach getting-started checklist, module access, surveys and team test sessions.",
    changelogEntry191: "Two-factor authentication is now available. Enable it in Profile → Security for an extra layer of protection at login.",
    changelogEntry192: "Licence and anti-doping alerts: you and your coach are now warned in the app and by email 30 days before a GAL/MyFightBook licence expires, or if the anti-doping course is missing or older than a year.",
    changelogEntry190: "Athletes can now mark a single diary entry as private. Private entries are hidden from all coaches, while the athlete always sees their own entries.",
    changelogEntry186: "Coaches can now set the weekly template directly on the season plan (which sessions the team trains each weekday, plus location and note). Coaches also always see the club season plan in the calendar, and athletes see the same sessions and technique focus in the grid — with a print button.",
    changelogEntry187: "Athlete dashboard redesigned: My Plan and Team Plan are now separate panels; Diary and Messages sit side-by-side.",
    changelogEntry188: "Coach dashboard simplified: each athlete card now leads with readiness, a weekly activity bar and a single status line — belt, mood, club and completion are still there, just quieter. Action icons appear on hover on desktop.",
    changelogEntry189: "Attendance redesigned as a tactical cockpit and PDF export added to the peaking & weight plan",
    changelogEntry183: "New \"Get started\" checklist on the coach dashboard shows the setup order: weekly schedule, season plan, athlete invitations and season plan visibility.",
    changelogEntry181: "New running tracking: activate a running program from the library and follow planned vs. actual kilometres per week on the Progress page — including quick run logging.",
    changelog_2026_07_23: "July 23, 2026",

    changelogEntry180: "Athlete signup is now invitation-only. Athletes get access through the invitation link from their coach; /auth is a dedicated sign-in page.",
    changelogEntry178: "New athletes now join via their club's invitation code. Individual athlete subscription removed — SportsTalent is a club and organization service. Existing club-less athletes keep their access.",
